<title>UK: GOLF-SECOND ROUND, 18-HOLE POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SECOND ROUND, 18-HOLE POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>WENTWORTH, England 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Positions after 18</p>
<p>holes of the 36-hole second round matches in the World Matchplay</p>
<p>championship on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Steve Stricker (U.S.) leads 1-Ernie Els (South Africa) by six</p>
<p>holes.</p>
<p>4-Mark Brooks (U.S.) leads Colin Montgomerie (Britain) by one</p>
<p>hole.</p>
<p>Vijay Singh (Fiji) leads 3-Steve Jones (U.S.) by three holes.</p>
<p>2-Tom Lehman (U.S.) leads Mark O'Meara (U.S.) by two holes.</p>
</text>
